@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:在巡视监牢二楼时，<br>我发现了一处不自然的地方。|#0201Adv17_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地图上明确显示对面有一个房间，<br>但却找不到能进入房间的门。|#0201Adv17_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:整面都是墙。|#0201Adv17_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:这个房间似乎没有门……|#0201Adv17_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是不是被魔法消除了呢？|#0201Adv17_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……倒是无法否定这个可能性。图书室里有棵大树，<br>　外面还有一直悬着彩虹的花田）|#0201Adv17_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这座监牢里不可思议的地方实在太多了。<br>　不得不接受这个现实啊）|#0201Adv17_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯——|#0201Adv17_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚稍作思考，<br>拿出了彩色喷漆。|#0201Adv17_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，你要干什——|#0201Adv17_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL5

; カラースプレー噴出音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_15 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:还没来得及阻止，<br>诺亚就在墙上画出了一扇门。|#0201Adv17_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:锵锵！因为没有门所以我就画了一个！|#0201Adv17_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这可不是“锵锵”就能蒙混过去的吧。<br>在这种地方涂鸦——|#0201Adv17_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:墙上描绘出的大门，<br>精细得难以称之为涂鸦。|#0201Adv17_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如此栩栩如生，<br>让我意识到诺亚的画技是多么惊人。|#0201Adv17_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后那扇门——|#0201Adv17_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 木の扉を開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_22 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:自然而然地打开了。|#0201Adv17_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸——！？真的开了！欸——！？|#0201Adv17_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……看来你的魔法与监牢的某种不可思议力量产生了互动，<br>起到了正面作用。|#0201Adv17_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。诺亚也很惊讶。<br>虽然诺亚会画画，但画的画从来没有变成真东西过。|#0201Adv17_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:其实诺亚<br>在其他地方也试过，<br>但那些都没有变成真正的门哦？|#0201Adv17_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那么，这只是让我们能进入这个房间而已。<br>　不过，能进入原本进不去的房间，<br>　也许也很重要）|#0201Adv17_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我们虽然有些困惑，<br>但还是穿过诺亚画的门，走了进去。|#0201Adv17_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
