[PrintTextModified Text:地上放着画布，<br>到处散落着许多素描。|#0201Adv17_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:木桌上杂乱地摆放着调色板和画笔，<br>四处还有飞溅的颜料痕迹……|#0201Adv17_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

; ＠備考◆感動

[PrintTextModified Text:哇……！！|#0201Adv17_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:这里面正是<br>诺亚梦寐以求的画室。|#0201Adv17_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:是画画的地方耶！<br>诺亚可以在这里画画吗！？|#0201Adv17_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，当然可以。<br>在这里你应该能尽情享受艺术创作了。|#0201Adv17_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:空气中混合着干燥的颜料香气，<br>和略显陈旧的木头气息。|#0201Adv17_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:里面还有一个可以俯瞰中庭的阳台。|#0201Adv17_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Noah Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:发现了一个超棒的地方！<br>好耶，好耶！|#0201Adv17_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着天真无邪地蹦跳的诺亚，<br>我的嘴角也不禁微微上扬。|#0201Adv17_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们四处看了看，<br>但这个房间并不像是什么特别重要的地方。|#0201Adv17_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这么说来，就像诺亚的魔法起作用让门出现一样，<br>　可能是某人的魔法让门消失了）|#0201Adv17_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

