[PrintTextModified Text:我们在画室里待了一会，<br>这期间其他少女们似乎也注意到了<br>这个房间的存在。|#0201Adv17_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:许多少女来到了画室。|#0201Adv17_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀这是……<br>诺亚，你找到了个好地方啊。|#0201Adv17_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯！<br>诺亚要把这里命名为【诺亚的画室】！|#0201Adv17_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

