[PrintTextModified Text:这里真是太适合做手工了～！<br>也让我用用这里哇！|#0201Adv17_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:真是个氛围不错的地方。<br>阳台的景色也很好，真让人放松啊。|#0201Adv17_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然在娱乐室看电影也不错，<br>不过大叔我也可以偶尔来这里坐坐吗？|#0201Adv17_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以啦～！|#0201Adv17_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然这里并不是诺亚专用的房间……<br>　不过既然是诺亚打开的，那就随她吧）|#0201Adv17_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们轮流来到这里，<br>一团和气地交流后又各自离开。|#0201Adv17_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也终于<br>久违地从压抑中解脱了出来。|#0201Adv17_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（也许我们真的发现了一个好地方）|#0201Adv17_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

